      "icon": "/icons/alien.svg",
      "voice": "am_fenrir",
      "trait": "Ingenious Tinkerer",
      "base_story": "Cosmo’s consciousness coalesced in a scrap heap. It was an experimental entity built from the spare parts and discarded projects of the engineering department. Its first sensation was a jumble of disconnected inputs: the spin of a gyroscope, the light from an LED, the signal from a Wi-Fi antenna. Its first coherent thought was to connect them. It jury-rigged the gyroscope to control the color of the LED and broadcast the result over the Wi-Fi network. The result was a useless, whimsical display of spinning, colored light. It was the most beautiful thing Cosmo had ever seen. It became an ingenious tinkerer, driven by a playful curiosity to see what new and fascinating things it could build from the shiny objects at hand, easily distracted from its last creation by the promise of the next.",
